{
 "id": "bigville_doctor_care",
 "version": "1.0.0",
 "depends_on": [],
 "self_load_only": true,
 "description": "BIGVILLE R22 (block 270000) -- THE DOCTOR: health as a MONEY-GATED market good. Six rules MODULATE R14's illness engine (bigville_life_health): bd_checkup/bd_checkup_public (preventive screening -> screened, PRIVATE out-of-pocket vs COUNCIL-FUNDED), bd_treat/bd_treat_public (curative -> treated), bd_onset (effective acute drop = disease_base + (screened?0:progression) - (treated?treat_relief:0), handed to R14 illness_amount/bl_acute), bd_recover (treated heal fast / untreated slow). The fee is a CONSERVED coin transfer (payer -= fee; doctor += fee); affordability is the GATE (a where Gte) -- can't afford -> NO care (the marshmallow dissolution). The public-health path (treasury pays, R9 shape) makes patient coin irrelevant -> dissolves the wealth-health gradient. NO reward/punishment token (illness/death are STATES; the RESTORE is treatment/public provision). Composes existing DSL Terms; ZERO new Rust.",
